{"id":"U09","title":"A Writing Exercise for Self-Forgiveness","titleZh":"自我宽恕的写作练习","paras":[{"id":"U09-P1","sentences":[{"id":"U09-P1-S1","hard":false,"text":"Taking responsibility for mistakes is a positive step, but don't beat yourself up about them."},{"id":"U09-P1-S2","hard":false,"text":"To err is human."},{"id":"U09-P1-S3","hard":true,"text":"It's just as important to show yourself some forgiveness."},{"id":"U09-P1-S4","hard":false,"text":"You can use the following writing exercise to help you do this."}],"zh":"为错误承担责任是积极的一步，但不要为此过分自责。人非圣贤，孰能无过。对自己展现一些宽恕同样重要。你可以使用下面的写作练习来帮助你做到这一点。"},{"id":"U09-P2","sentences":[{"id":"U09-P2-S1","hard":false,"text":"In a journal or on a piece of paper, put the heading \"Personal strengths\"."},{"id":"U09-P2-S2","hard":false,"text":"Now list all the characteristics you like about yourself."},{"id":"U09-P2-S3","hard":false,"text":"Are you caring?"},{"id":"U09-P2-S4","hard":false,"text":"Creative?"},{"id":"U09-P2-S5","hard":false,"text":"Generous?"},{"id":"U09-P2-S6","hard":false,"text":"A good listener?"},{"id":"U09-P2-S7","hard":false,"text":"Fun to be around?"},{"id":"U09-P2-S8","hard":false,"text":"They don't have to be world-changing, just aspects of your personality that you're proud of."}],"zh":"在日记或一张纸上，写上标题\"个人长处\"。现在列出你喜欢自己的所有特点。你有爱心吗？有创造力吗？慷慨大方吗？善于倾听吗？相处起来很有趣吗？它们不必是改变世界的，只要是你引以为豪的性格方面就行。"},{"id":"U09-P3","sentences":[{"id":"U09-P3-S1","hard":false,"text":"At the top of a second page, put the heading \"Acts of kindness\"."},{"id":"U09-P3-S2","hard":false,"text":"On this one, list all the positive things you've done for others."},{"id":"U09-P3-S3","hard":true,"text":"It might be the time when you helped a friend with their homework, when you did the ironing without being asked, or when you baked cookies after the family had had a tiring day."},{"id":"U09-P3-S4","hard":false,"text":"Whatever it is, no matter how small it might seem, write it down."}],"zh":"在第二页的顶部，写上标题\"善举\"。在这一页上，列出你为他人做过的所有积极的事情。可能是你帮助朋友做作业的时候，是你主动熨衣服的时候，或是家人度过疲惫的一天后你烤了饼干的时候。不管是什么，无论看起来多么微小，都写下来。"},{"id":"U09-P4","sentences":[{"id":"U09-P4-S1","hard":false,"text":"You could ask a friend or family member to help add to your list."},{"id":"U09-P4-S2","hard":false,"text":"They might even like to have a go at doing the exercise."},{"id":"U09-P4-S3","hard":true,"text":"That way, you could exchange thoughts on what makes each of you special and the aspects of your personality that shine through."},{"id":"U09-P4-S4","hard":false,"text":"In fact, don't wait until you've made a mistake to try this--it's a great way to boost self-confidence at any time."}],"zh":"你可以请朋友或家人帮忙补充你的清单。他们甚至可能想尝试一下这个练习。这样，你们就可以交流想法，讨论是什么让你们每个人与众不同，以及你们性格中闪耀的方面。事实上，不要等到犯了错才尝试这个——这是在任何时候增强自信的好方法。"},{"id":"U09-P5","sentences":[{"id":"U09-P5-S1","hard":true,"text":"It's something of a cliche that most people learn not from their successes but their mistakes."},{"id":"U09-P5-S2","hard":false,"text":"The thing is, it's true."},{"id":"U09-P5-S3","hard":false,"text":"Whatever the mistake, remember it isn't a fixed aspect of your personality."},{"id":"U09-P5-S4","hard":false,"text":"We're all changing and learning all the time and mistakes are a positive way to develop and grow."}],"zh":"大多数人不是从成功中学习，而是从错误中学习，这多少有点老生常谈。但事实是，这是真的。无论是什么错误，记住它不是你性格中固定不变的方面。我们都在不断变化和学习，错误是发展和成长的积极方式。"}],"words":[{"id":"U09-W01","lemma":"responsibility","surface":"responsibility","pos":"n.","zh":"责任; 职责","sent":"U09-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"take responsibility for","zh":"对...承担责任"},{"en":"sense of responsibility","zh":"责任感"}]},{"id":"U09-W02","lemma":"positive","surface":"positive","pos":"adj.","zh":"积极的; 正面的; 肯定的","sent":"U09-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"positive step","zh":"积极的一步"},{"en":"positive attitude","zh":"积极的态度"}]},{"id":"U09-W03","lemma":"beat yourself up","surface":"beat yourself up","pos":"phr.","zh":"过分自责; 苛求自己","sent":"U09-P1-S1","phrases":[{"en":"don't beat yourself up","zh":"不要过分自责"}]},{"id":"U09-W04","lemma":"err","surface":"err","pos":"v.","zh":"犯错; 出错","sent":"U09-P1-S2","phrases":[{"en":"to err is human","zh":"人非圣贤，孰能无过"}]},{"id":"U09-W05","lemma":"forgiveness","surface":"forgiveness","pos":"n.","zh":"宽恕; 原谅","sent":"U09-P1-S3","phrases":[{"en":"show forgiveness","zh":"展现宽恕"},{"en":"ask for forgiveness","zh":"请求原谅"}]},{"id":"U09-W06","lemma":"following","surface":"following","pos":"adj. / n.","zh":"adj. 以下的; 接下来的 n. 追随者","sent":"U09-P1-S4","phrases":[{"en":"the following exercise","zh":"下面的练习"}]},{"id":"U09-W07","lemma":"journal","surface":"journal","pos":"n.","zh":"日记; 期刊","sent":"U09-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"keep a journal","zh":"写日记"},{"en":"academic journal","zh":"学术期刊"}]},{"id":"U09-W08","lemma":"heading","surface":"heading","pos":"n.","zh":"标题; _heading","sent":"U09-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"put the heading","zh":"写上标题"}]},{"id":"U09-W09","lemma":"strength","surface":"strengths","pos":"n.","zh":"长处; 力量; 优势","sent":"U09-P2-S1","phrases":[{"en":"personal strengths","zh":"个人长处"},{"en":"strengths and weaknesses","zh":"优缺点"}]},{"id":"U09-W10","lemma":"list","surface":"list","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 列出; 列举 n. 清单; 列表","sent":"U09-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"make a list","zh":"列清单"},{"en":"on the list","zh":"在清单上"}]},{"id":"U09-W11","lemma":"characteristic","surface":"characteristics","pos":"n. / adj.","zh":"n. 特点; 特征 adj. 特有的; 典型的","sent":"U09-P2-S2","phrases":[{"en":"personal characteristics","zh":"个人特点"}]},{"id":"U09-W12","lemma":"caring","surface":"caring","pos":"adj.","zh":"有爱心的; 关心他人的","sent":"U09-P2-S3","phrases":[{"en":"caring nature","zh":"有爱心的天性"}]},{"id":"U09-W13","lemma":"creative","surface":"Creative","pos":"adj.","zh":"有创造力的; 创造性的","sent":"U09-P2-S4","phrases":[{"en":"creative thinking","zh":"创造性思维"}]},{"id":"U09-W14","lemma":"generous","surface":"Generous","pos":"adj.","zh":"慷慨的; 大方的","sent":"U09-P2-S5","phrases":[{"en":"generous with","zh":"对...慷慨"}]},{"id":"U09-W15","lemma":"aspect","surface":"aspects","pos":"n.","zh":"方面; 层面","sent":"U09-P2-S8","phrases":[{"en":"all aspects of","zh":"...的各个方面"},{"en":"positive aspects","zh":"积极的方面"}]},{"id":"U09-W16","lemma":"personality","surface":"personality","pos":"n.","zh":"性格; 个性; 人格","sent":"U09-P2-S8","phrases":[{"en":"aspects of personality","zh":"性格方面"},{"en":"strong personality","zh":"鲜明的个性"}]},{"id":"U09-W17","lemma":"top","surface":"top","pos":"n. / adj. / v.","zh":"n. 顶部; 顶端 adj. 最高的; 顶部的 v. 超过; 居...之首","sent":"U09-P3-S1","phrases":[{"en":"at the top of","zh":"在...的顶部"},{"en":"top student","zh":"尖子生"}]},{"id":"U09-W18","lemma":"act","surface":"Acts","pos":"n. / v.","zh":"n. 行为; 举动; 法案 v. 行动; 表演","sent":"U09-P3-S1","phrases":[{"en":"acts of kindness","zh":"善举"},{"en":"act as","zh":"充当; 担任"}]},{"id":"U09-W19","lemma":"kindness","surface":"kindness","pos":"n.","zh":"善良; 仁慈; 好意","sent":"U09-P3-S1","phrases":[{"en":"acts of kindness","zh":"善举"},{"en":"show kindness to","zh":"对...表示善意"}]},{"id":"U09-W20","lemma":"iron","surface":"ironing","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 熨烫 n. 铁; 熨斗","sent":"U09-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"do the ironing","zh":"熨衣服"}]},{"id":"U09-W21","lemma":"bake","surface":"baked","pos":"v.","zh":"烘焙; 烘烤","sent":"U09-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"bake cookies","zh":"烤饼干"},{"en":"bake a cake","zh":"烤蛋糕"}]},{"id":"U09-W22","lemma":"cookie","surface":"cookies","pos":"n.","zh":"饼干; 曲奇","sent":"U09-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"bake cookies","zh":"烤饼干"}]},{"id":"U09-W23","lemma":"tiring","surface":"tiring","pos":"adj.","zh":"累人的; 令人疲惫的","sent":"U09-P3-S3","phrases":[{"en":"a tiring day","zh":"疲惫的一天"}]},{"id":"U09-W24","lemma":"add","surface":"add","pos":"v.","zh":"添加; 增加","sent":"U09-P4-S1","phrases":[{"en":"add to","zh":"补充; 增加"},{"en":"add up","zh":"加起来"}]},{"id":"U09-W25","lemma":"have a go","surface":"have a go","pos":"phr.","zh":"尝试一下; 试一试","sent":"U09-P4-S2","phrases":[{"en":"have a go at","zh":"尝试..."}]},{"id":"U09-W26","lemma":"exchange","surface":"exchange","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 交流; 交换 n. 交换; 交易所","sent":"U09-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"exchange thoughts","zh":"交流想法"},{"en":"in exchange for","zh":"作为...的交换"}]},{"id":"U09-W27","lemma":"shine","surface":"shine","pos":"v.","zh":"闪耀; 发光; 表现出色","sent":"U09-P4-S3","phrases":[{"en":"shine through","zh":"显露出来; 闪耀"},{"en":"shine in","zh":"在...方面表现出色"}]},{"id":"U09-W28","lemma":"boost","surface":"boost","pos":"v. / n.","zh":"v. 增强; 促进 n. 提升; 推动","sent":"U09-P4-S4","phrases":[{"en":"boost self-confidence","zh":"增强自信"},{"en":"boost morale","zh":"鼓舞士气"}]},{"id":"U09-W29","lemma":"cliche","surface":"cliche","pos":"n.","zh":"陈词滥调; 老生常谈","sent":"U09-P5-S1","phrases":[{"en":"something of a cliche","zh":"多少有点老生常谈"}]},{"id":"U09-W30","lemma":"fixed","surface":"fixed","pos":"adj.","zh":"固定的; 不变的","sent":"U09-P5-S3","phrases":[{"en":"fixed aspect","zh":"固定的方面"},{"en":"fixed price","zh":"固定价格"}]}],"_v":1786413566727}